observed = "decodeMessage decodes hex with nonfatal UTF-8 and allocates bytes.length / 2 without rejecting odd hex. personal_sign then passes the resulting text to the vendored signMessage and /v1/wallet/sign-message. For 0xff the signer receives replacement-character UTF-8 rather than the requested byte; an odd trailing nibble is discarded."
